  "bodyHash": "1f400c1d14e8b862",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_f847fd45-3424-4a86-a9f3-bd3ff2aaf332.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"933\" height=\"437\"></p>\n<p><strong>你一直想在 Epic Fight 中使用火槍，但它們卻沒有動畫嗎？別擔心，這個模組就是為了讓 Epic Fight 與 ewewukek 的火槍模組相容而開發的。</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_ec4f8799-24c1-44f2-ab72-49cffcbea67a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></strong></p>\n<p>此模組為各種類型的火槍新增了 5 套自訂招式組，並內建與 Ewewukek 的火槍模組以及 Warrior's of Last Epoch 的相容性。此模組也能讓生物正確地使用火槍，而不僅僅是進行近戰攻擊。同時還附帶一套自訂護甲套裝。建議搭配此資源包使用效果最佳。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/flintl0cks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/flintl0cks</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_81bb9861-9439-4f75-8115-ca1ef71b215a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_939cf738-74ce-4b3e-987c-df515668bc3e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_c675e2e4-f405-4b7c-83b8-1d844b19328f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_b668bce3-3a93-437c-929b-67e3b1c3577e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_69f30333-e38f-4928-873f-934bda08c1b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"484\" height=\"256\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>鳴謝</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1210967/description_ec9bff0e-c75b-4daa-8b25-fef0c1149dc8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"198\">特別感謝 Yonchi、Forixiam 和 Arcane 協助我開發此模組。</p>",
